    "text": "<p>Two compounds <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> with same molecular formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> undergo Grignard reaction with methylmagnesium bromide to give products <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>. Products <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> show following chemical tests.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Test</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>C</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>D</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Ceric ammonium&nbsp;nitrate&nbsp;Test</td>\t\t\t<td>Positive</td>\t\t\t<td>Positive</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Lucas Test</td>\t\t\t<td>Turbidity obtained&nbsp;after five&nbsp;minutes</td>\t\t\t<td>Turbidity obtained Immediately</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Iodoform Test</td>\t\t\t<td>Positive</td>\t\t\t<td>Negative</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> respectively are</p>"
